{"unit_id":"tag:04TM:statement","translation":"本例与例<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>类似，只是使用预层（presheaves）代替“范畴（categories）的预层（presheaves）”。得到的将是一个范畴（category），它是集合（sets）纤维的，而非纤维范畴（fibred category）。设<MATH_0001>是预层（presheaf）。对<MATH_0002>（属于<MATH_0003>），我们将使用暗示性的记法<MATH_0004>。我们如下构造范畴（category）<MATH_0005>，它在<MATH_0006>上方是集合（sets）纤维的。定义<MATH_0007>。对<MATH_0008>，我们定义<MATH_0009>。复合（Composition）继承自<MATH_0010>中的复合（composition），它按<MATH_0011>作用，适用于<MATH_0012>的一对可复合的态射（morphisms）。函子（functor）<MATH_0013>由规则<MATH_0014>给出。由于每个纤维范畴（category）<MATH_0015>都是离散的（discrete），其底层集合（set）为<MATH_0016>，而且我们在例<REF_0003>中已经看到<MATH_0017>是群胚纤维范畴（category fibred in groupoids），故得出<MATH_0018>是集合（sets）纤维的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"fibred category","target_term":"纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"discrete","target_term":"离散的"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"包括presheaf，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"包括category，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"包括set，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fibred category","target_term":"纤维范畴","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Composition","target_term":"复合","context":"包括composition，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_t